---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /press/index.html
title: Press & Contact
description: Press photographs, review excerpts, and contact information for Harrington & Kauffman.
---
{% set pressByName = pressImages.items | byFilename %}
<div class="page">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Press &amp; Contact</p><h1>Useful facts and very large pictures</h1><p class="prose">Harrington &amp; Kauffman are Richard Harrington and Chris Kauffman, a comedy-theater duo who perform as Belgian cabaret singer Gustave and his mostly mute associate Nhar. Their three original stage shows have toured fringe festivals, theaters, and colleges in North America and internationally.</p></header>
  <section aria-labelledby="photos-title"><p class="eyebrow">Press photographs</p><h2 id="photos-title">Provisional selection</h2><p>Download links provide the untouched original files. The page itself uses generated web-sized derivatives.</p>
    <div class="image-grid">{% for item in pressImages.items %}{% if item.curated %}{% set source = item.filename | findImage %}<figure class="image-card">{% image item.filename, item.caption, "", "(max-width: 47rem) 50vw, 26vw" %}<figcaption>{{ item.caption }}{% if item.photographer %}<br>Photograph by {{ item.photographer }}.{% else %}<br><span class="review-marker">TBD — PHOTOGRAPHER/CAPTION</span>{% endif %}<br><a href="{{ source.source }}" download>Download original</a> ({{ source.width }} × {{ source.height }})</figcaption></figure>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="reviews-title"><p class="eyebrow">In print</p><h2 id="reviews-title">Selected review excerpts</h2><ul class="review-list">{% for review in reviews.items %}<li><blockquote><p>“{{ review.text }}”</p><footer>— {{ review.critic }}, <cite>{{ review.publication }}</cite>, {{ review.year }} · <a href="/shows/#{% if review.production == 'Motel California' %}motel-california{% elseif review.production == 'Nharcolepsy' %}nharcolepsy{% else %}cabaret-terrarium{% endif %}"><em>{{ review.production }}</em></a></footer></blockquote></li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>
  <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><h2 id="contact-title">Send a message</h2><div class="contact-grid"><div><p>For bookings, press requests, and other correspondence:</p><p><a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a><br>{% if not site.contact.verified %}<span class="review-marker">TBD — VERIFY EMAIL</span>{% endif %}</p></div>
    <form class="contact-form" name="contact" method="post" action="/thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company-website"><input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact"><p class="honeypot"><label>Do not fill this out if you are human: <input name="company-website" type="text" autocomplete="off" tabindex="-1"></label></p><div class="field"><label for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div><div class="field"><label for="message">Message</label><textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea></div><button type="submit">Send message</button></form></div>
  </section>
  <section class="overflow" aria-labelledby="overflow-title"><h2 id="overflow-title">TBD — THESE ARE OVERFLOW</h2><p>This review-only comparison area shows every remaining file in the image directory. Promote or reject these before launch; the permanent <a href="/press/image-archive/">Image Archive</a> will retain every original.</p><div class="image-grid">{% for source in imageArchive %}{% set detail = pressByName[source.filename] %}{% if not detail or not detail.curated %}<figure class="image-card">{% image source.filename, detail.caption if detail else source.filename, "", "(max-width: 31rem) 100vw, (max-width: 65rem) 33vw, 20vw" %}<figcaption><strong>{{ source.filename }}</strong><br>{% if detail %}{{ detail.caption }}{% if detail.photographer %} Photograph by {{ detail.photographer }}.{% endif %}{% else %}<span class="review-marker">TBD — PHOTOGRAPHER/CAPTION. INFERRED FROM FILENAME: {{ source.filename }}</span>{% endif %}<br><a href="{{ source.source }}" download>Download original</a></figcaption></figure>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></section>
</div>
